# exp2_search_latency
#
# Written here by the harness (README §9):
#   raw_runs.csv   one row per run, never aggregated
#   results.csv    aggregated means with 95% CI, read by Plots/generate_plots.py
#   run_meta.json  provenance, including why a run is or is not reportable
#
# Committed empty because Plots/generate_plots.py walks
# Schemes/*/exp<N>_*/results.csv and skips schemes with no results, so the
# folder must exist before any run. Results are committed separately from code
# (README §12), so nothing here is tracked yet.
